parameters.text:
=Create a personalized research networking and collaboration action plan.

Profile: {{ $('Set Research Profile').item.json.profile }}
Research Focus: {{ $('Set Research Profile').item.json.research_focus }}
Target Labs: {{ $('Set Research Profile').item.json.target_labs }}

Active Research Groups Found:
{{ $('Find Active Research Groups').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Collaboration Opportunities:
{{ $('Find Collaboration Opportunities').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Research Internships:
{{ $('Find Research Internships').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Return JSON:
{
  "target_professors": [{"name": "", "lab": "", "research_match": "high/medium", "recent_work": "", "contact_strategy": ""}],
  "open_source_contributions": [{"project": "", "why_relevant": "", "entry_point": "", "url": ""}],
  "internship_opportunities": [{"organization": "", "program": "", "deadline": "", "match": "high/medium"}],
  "this_week_actions": [],
  "30_day_plan": [],
  "summary": "3-4 sentence strategic summary"
}

=🔬 *Research Network Update — {{ $now.toFormat('MMM dd') }}*

{{ $json.summary }}

*Target Professors (high match):*
{{ $json.target_professors.filter(p=>p.research_match==='high').slice(0,3).map(p=>`• ${p.name} (${p.lab}): ${p.recent_work}`).join('\n') }}

*Open Source: Start Contributing Now:*
{{ $json.open_source_contributions.slice(0,2).map(c=>`• ${c.project}: ${c.entry_point}`).join('\n') }}

*This Week:*
{{ $json.this_week_actions.map(a=>`• ${a}`).join('\n') }}
